{"id":"word:hebrew:H6913","type":"word","title":"קֶבֶר","subtitle":"H6913 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a sepulchre","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to קֶבֶר (H6913) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 67 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"קֶבֶר (qeber) means a sepulchre First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 13 22."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"קֶבֶר","transliteration":"qeber","pronunciation":"keh'-ber","strong":"H6913","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6913","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["קָ֑בֶר","קָֽבֶר","קֶ֥בֶר","בְּ/קִבְר֥וֹת","קִבְרֵ֣י"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",12],["HR/Ncmsc",7],["HNcmpc",5],["HNcmsc",4],["HRd/Ncmsa",4],["HR/Ncmpc",4],["HTd/Ncmpa",3],["HNcmpc/Sp3fs",3],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",3],["HNcmpc/Sp2ms",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"a sepulchre","usage":"burying place, grave, sepulchre.","full":"H6913. qeber קֶ֫בֶר 67 noun masculine 1Kin 13:31 grave, sepulchre ; — absolute ׳ק Gen 23:4 +, קָ֑בֶר 1Kin 14:13 +; construct קֶבֶר Judg 8:32 +; suffix קִבְרִי Gen 50:5 , etc.; plural קְבָרִים Exod 14:11 +, construct קִבְדֵי Jer 26:23 +, suffix קִבְרֵיהֶם 8:1 ; also קְבָרוֺת Job 21:32 , construct קִבְרוֺת Neh 2:3 +, suffix קִבְרֹתָיו Exod 32:23 ; 2Chr 16:14 , etc.; — grave, sepulchre , Judg 8:32 ; 2Sam 2:32 ; 1Kin 13:22 +; ק ׳אֲחֻזַּת Gen 23:4 ; 23:9 ; Genesis 23:30; 49:30 ; 50:13 ; hewn out ( חָצַב ) Isa 22:16 (twice in verse); אוּבָ֑ל לַקֶּבֶר מִכֶּטֶן Job 10:19 ; figurative אִמִּ ׳וַתְּהִילִֿי ׳ק Jer 20:17 ; ק ׳שֹׁכְבֵי Psa 88:6 the slain lying in grave ; כַּקְּבָרִים הַיּשְׁבִים Isa 65:4 they who sit in the tombs (occult rite, probably in necromancy, etc., compare Che and RS Semitic I.180 ff.; 2nd ed. 197 ff. ); הָעָם בְּנֵי קֶבֶר 2Kin 23:6 i.e. burial-place of common people, so הָעָם בְּנֵי קִבְרֵי Jer 26:23 ; plural intensive Job 17:1 , also of stately (royal) sepulchre 2Kin 22:20 = 2Chr 34:28 ; Neh 3:16 ; 2Chr 16:14 ; compare 35:24 ; Job 21:32 ; conceived as in lower world Ezek 32:22-23 , 25 , 26 , || אֲבַדּוֺן Psa 88:12 ; 49:12 read קְבָרִים for || קִרְבָּם Vrss and most; ׳ק מָּתוּחַ simile of quiver Jer 5:16 ; figurative ׳ק ׳פ גְּרֹנָם Psa 5:10 ; of exile Ezek 37:12 (twice in verse); 37:13 (twice in verse).","rootNote":"or (feminine) קִבְרָה ; from 6912 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 13 22","keyReferences":["1Kgs 13 22","1Kgs 13 30","1Kgs 13 31","1Kgs 14 13","2Chr 16 14","2Chr 21 20","2Chr 24 25","2Chr 28 27"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":67,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 13 22","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קֶ֥בֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 30","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/קִבְר֑/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 31","book":"1Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/קֶּ֕בֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 14 13","book":"1Kgs","chapter":14,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קָ֑בֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 16 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":16,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְ/קִבְרֹתָ֗י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 21 20","book":"2Chr","chapter":21,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/קִבְר֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"2Chr 24 25","book":"2Chr","chapter":24,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/קִבְר֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"2Chr 28 27","book":"2Chr","chapter":28,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/קִבְרֵ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 33","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִבְרֵ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":